Sweep 110 layer/expert pairs across all 48 layers. Output-space holdout
cosine against the 0.8604 D23 bar, packed bytes from real codec payloads,
and a 16-sample matched-magnitude null per organ.

No recipe in the grid — including the packed 1.444 mixed-1p5 artifact —
clears the bar on all three organs. down_proj is the binding organ
(holdout mean 0.768 at hgravs01_r160). Sub-0.655 complete BPW requires
leaving the binary family and drops min organ cosine to ~0.69.

Identity coefficients have not moved. Non-expert 8->4 saves 0.119
complete BPW; the rest has to come from routed experts near 0.42-0.55.
Sub-100 fs/weight is unreachable for Q80 at preserved capability.
